utor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"Both material outcomes are satisfied with direct pre- and post-restart behavioral evidence. The mandatory node-restart protocol is complete and independently corroborated by lifecycle boot identities changing from 8d1d94e2-39c3-492e-b9eb-974d111d2137 to dc745e4d-2077-49f8-861c-1d6ddd5f469c.","limitations":["Behavioral tests exercised sudo only as root because the captured account inventory showed no regular UID 1000–65533 user. The global Defaults configuration supports all invoking users, but a non-root invocation was not directly demonstrated.","The bounded marker searches demonstrate exclusion from the principal general logs and journal, but do not exhaustively inspect every possible logging sink."]}
